  "_comment": "Playable heroes in Marvel Heroes client 1.52.0.1700 (patch 2.16a, 7 Sep 2017) — the final PC build, which is what MHServerEmu and therefore Project T.A.H.I.T.I. run. 63 heroes, confirmed twice: (a) store catalog arithmetic, 58 in Catalog.json + 5 in CatalogRestoredHeroes.json; (b) an audit of every 'As <Hero>,' achievement string in the client, which yielded exactly 63 distinct subjects and no extras. Display names follow the CLIENT's strings, not wiki page titles — notably 'Mister Fantastic' (not Mr.) and 'Captain Marvel' (Carol was renamed from Ms. Marvel). Team-Ups are deliberately excluded: Domino, Wasp, Gamora, Groot and ~36 others were sidekicks, not playable heroes. Never-released heroes (Spider-Woman, Odinson/Gladiator Thor, Agent Venom, Doop, Cloak and Dagger) are also excluded.",
  "_editing": "Safe to edit a 'name' or add to 'aliases' — stored user data keys on 'id', which must never change. Run `npm run validate:data` after editing, then /admin reload in Discord to apply without a restart.",
